    "ui": {
     "hidden": true,
     "strings": {
      "en": {
       "bullets": [
        {
         "description": "Our platform is available in multiple languages. We can give service from any of the IBM Cloud datacenters around the world. If we are not present in your closest datacenter.",
         "title": "Multi-site and Multi-language collaboration"
        },
        {
         "description": "Multi factor authentication supported in the key layers of the platform.",
         "title": "Content security management with MFA support"
        },
        {
         "description": "We provide access from our dashboard to the statistics of usage of your studio in SimpleCloud in real time",
         "title": "User usage metering and real time monitoring"
        },
        {
         "description": "Any proprietary or 3PP software can be installed in our virtual workstations, and you can select the software that is going to be used in each workstation profile just with a drag and drop movement of your mouse.",
         "title": "Support of any commercial and proprietary software with instant and dynamic deployment to users"
        },
        {
         "description": "The license model for 3PP software is bring your own license, and to make it as easy as possible, every studio has a license server that is automatically created within the studio where you can manage your licenses.",
         "title": "Third party license management"
        },
        {
         "description": "You can directly select the amount of resources that is going to be available for your studio in real time.",
         "title": "Resource self-provisioning"
        },
        {
         "description": "Virtual workstation and storage available in Linux and Windows OS",
         "title": "Linux/Windows environments"
        },
        {
         "description": "To meet the needs of Studios and Companies that already have their own infrastructure but need to extend it to the cloud to give access to remote team members who are in different geographic locations while maintaining data security, SimpleCloud has developed a solution which performs a continuous synchronization between the local storage and SimpleCloud, allowing for all members access at all times.",
         "title": "Hybrid environment solutions"
        },
        {
         "description": "A complete automated workflow is available and completely configurable.",
         "title": "Workflow customizations"
        },
        {
         "description": "Our platform is based in the Nvidia Grid virtualization that allows our users to enjoy all the power of the CUDA processors of the Nvidia graphic cards in their virtual workstations desktops and when they use it for processing or rendering tasks.",
         "title": "CUDA processing and viewport"
        },
        {
         "description": "Wacom boards are fully compatible with our platform and many other human interface devices as well",
         "title": "Wacom and other HID native and performant Support "
        },
        {
         "description": "You can integer any digital asset manager you use in our worflow.",
         "title": "DAM integration (Shotgun, Ftrack, Excel, Project, proprietary ….)"
        },
